        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.25,
          "end": 12.81,
          "en": "It's very simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.81,
          "end": 15.33,
          "en": "You can specify a path here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.33,
          "end": 18.3,
          "en": "because you might have a nested form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.3,
          "end": 22.86,
          "en": "Let's say username and email should be inside a FormGroup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.86,
          "end": 26.1,
          "en": "We used such forms in the template driven approach too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.1,
          "end": 29.76,
          "en": "So here we could create a FormGroup named userData.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.76,
          "end": 32.433,
          "en": "And now this is a new FormGroup again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.476,
          "end": 37.32,
          "en": "FormGroup is not only there to be used on the overall form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.32,
          "end": 40.35,
          "en": "that just happens to be a FormGroup too.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.35,
          "end": 44.04,
          "en": "But you can't still have FormGroups in FormGroups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.04,
          "end": 46.02,
          "en": "So here we could have a FormGroup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.02,
          "end": 48.48,
          "en": "which of course like the outer FormGroup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.48,
          "end": 52.98,
          "en": "for the overall form also takes a JavaScript object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.98,
          "end": 57.98,
          "en": "And now we can add our FormControls inside of this group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.34,
          "end": 62.46,
          "en": "So now we have a nested form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.46,
          "end": 65.1,
          "en": "We need to reflect this in our HTML template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.1,
          "end": 68.1,
          "en": "because right now if we have a look at our form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.1,
          "end": 69.21000000000001,
          "en": "it will break.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.21000000000001,
          "end": 73.32,
          "en": "You see this in the console, we get an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.32,
          "end": 76.05,
          "en": "because correctly it cannot find a control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.05,
          "end": 80.37,
          "en": "with the name username because on the overall form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.37,
          "end": 82.08,
          "en": "there is no such control.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.08,
          "end": 83.98,
          "en": "It's nested in the userData FormGroup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.05,
          "end": 88.71000000000001,
          "en": "So first of all we need to update our synchronization",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.71000000000001,
          "end": 93.71000000000001,
          "en": "and we easily do this by wrapping our FormControls here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.89,
