        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 183.24,
          "end": 187.23,
          "en": "So if you have a new object, just place a dot in between.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 187.23,
          "end": 190.41,
          "en": "So let's paste it everywhere where we used one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 190.41,
          "end": 193.98,
          "en": "of these nested controls for email as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.98,
          "end": 197.13,
          "en": "Therefore, and if we now save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 197.13,
          "end": 201.03,
          "en": "it should update and not display any errors anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 201.03,
          "end": 204.78,
          "en": "Instead, we should see the behavior we saw before",
